---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Cooperate from '../components/Cooperate.astro';
import portraits from '../data/portraits.json';
const pickJs = `(function(){var L=${JSON.stringify(portraits)},im=document.getElementById('apimg');if(!im||!L.length)return;var P=im.parentNode;P.classList.add('has-photo');var u=L[Math.floor(Math.random()*L.length)],f=0;im.onload=function(){im.classList.add('on')};im.onerror=function(){im.remove();P.classList.remove('has-photo');};im.src=u;})();`;
---
<Base title="关于 · 幕景宇宙" active="/about/" navClass="top--unified">
<main class="wrap about-page">

<div class="studio-intro reveal">
  <p class="kicker cap">About · 关于</p>
  <h1>以创作为核心的<br/>AIGC 文化艺术团队</h1>
  <p class="lead">幕景宇宙（Mujing Universe）是杭州的 AIGC 文化艺术团队。我们用 AI 重新看待古画与民乐，让传统审美以新的形态进入当代展览与公共空间。团队名称"幕景"来自艺术家作品《幕景 Scendance》。</p>
</div>

<div class="members">

  <div class="member reveal">
    <div class="member-photo portrait">
      <img id="apimg" class="pimg" alt="林丽丽 肖像" width="900" height="1200" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"/>
      <script is:inline set:html={pickJs}></script>
      <span class="serif">林<br/>丽<br/>丽</span>
    </div>
    <div class="member-info">
      <p class="kicker cap">艺术家 · 创作</p>
      <h2>林丽丽 <small>Lili Lin</small></h2>
      <p>首尔大学城市与区域规划硕士，华中科技大学建筑学出身。以画面与空间为语言，把 AI、古典美学与三维做成可看、可交互的作品。作品版权所有者，未来 OPC 主体。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="member reveal">
    <div class="member-photo portrait has-photo">
      <img class="pimg on" src="/team-zhongshu.jpg" alt="丁科智 肖像" width="900" height="1200" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/>
    </div>
    <div class="member-info">
      <p class="kicker cap">经纪 · 管理 · 声音</p>
      <h2>丁科智 <small>Ke-Zhi Ding</small></h2>
      <p>浙江音乐学院硕士在读，负责艺术家经纪、项目统筹与展览商务对接，参与音画线的声音设计部分。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<section class="narrow endcap reveal">
  <a class="btn" href="/works/">浏览作品 →</a>
  <Cooperate />
</section>

</main>
<style>
.about-page { padding-top: 80px; }

.studio-intro { max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 80px; }
.studio-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.25; margin: 16px 0 20px; }
.lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.8; }

.members { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 72px; }

.member { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr; gap: 52px; align-items: start; padding-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }

.portrait {
  aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 28px 24px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.pimg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.35s ease; }
.pimg.on { opacity: 1; }
.portrait.has-photo .serif { display: none; }
.portrait .serif { position: relative; z-index: 2; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 3.5vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--ink2); }

.member-info { padding-top: 4px; }
.member-info h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 8px 0 16px; }
.member-info h2 small {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-left: 10px;
  font-family: var(--en), var(--sans);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  color: var(--ink2);
}
.member-info p { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.8; }

.endcap { text-align: center; margin-top: 88px; }
.endcap .btn { margin: 6px; }

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .studio-intro { margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .member { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  .portrait { max-width: 220px; }
  .members { gap: 48px; }
}
</style>
</Base>
